{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has declared war on God. In response, God has declared war on the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words\u2014<strong>it\u2019s time for that fucking crusade.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOLY Intentions</strong> is a fast-paced fusion between a Souls-like and an ultraviolent FPS. History has been shattered, Earth itself remade, and an ancient cult\u2014the <strong>Order of Majistos</strong>\u2014rules from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Crusader</strong>, destined to tear their empire apart. Return the <strong>fear of God</strong> to this world with blade, blood, and unrelenting holy fire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal, Visceral Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the <strong>Dragonsword</strong>, a living dragon forged into a weapon of divine wrath.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield <strong> devastating holy powers</strong>\u2014like firing Lightning Nukes or calling down Comets from divine trebuchets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness elemental movement: blast into the skies with\u00a0<strong>Flame,\u00a0walk on hurricanes, surf on lightning bolts.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy mortality: <strong>heal by taking damage.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/99a2551f8a8618bccecf55455e581494.poster.avif?t=1762421063\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/99a2551f8a8618bccecf55455e581494.webm?t=1762421063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/99a2551f8a8618bccecf55455e581494.mp4?t=1762421063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Epic Blend Between Mythology and Dark Fantasy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entirety of Earth has been Isekai'd to\u00a0<strong>The Planet Graveyard</strong>\u2014a star system where dying worlds and fallen civilizations are exiled to rot. Across this cosmic necropolis, <strong>Gothic cathedrals and towering spires</strong> cast their shadows over kingdoms in ruin. Here the <strong>Order of Majistos</strong> thrives, an ancient cult whose influence strangles every corner of existence<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast mystical levels to uncover the secrets of a world where even heaven itself has been cast into exile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/43988d25b6c0cbb1907dc18980fc1456.poster.avif?t=1762421063\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/43988d25b6c0cbb1907dc18980fc1456.webm?t=1762421063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/43988d25b6c0cbb1907dc18980fc1456.mp4?t=1762421063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008930?t=1762421063","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008930?t=1762421063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/e01081510cfd9afac1ddb90463ba43ad22eaca2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762421063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat